Privacy Policy for Varna Text Processor
Last updated: June 14, 2026

Varna Text Processor ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use the Varna Text Processor mobile application.

1. Offline-First & Privacy-Focused Architecture
Varna Text Processor is designed to function as an offline-first application.

Local Processing: All text generation, grammar checking, paraphrasing, and document processing happen entirely locally on your mobile device.

Zero Data Transmission: Your typed text, drafted emails, speeches, stories, and edited documents are never sent to our servers, nor are they monitored, stored, or collected by us.

2. Local AI Model Execution & External Downloads
To provide advanced AI capabilities completely offline, the application utilizes the Qwen Large Language Model (LLM) executing via Google MediaPipe.

One-Time Model Download: Upon initial setup or feature activation, the application requires an active internet connection to securely download the necessary AI model weights and language processing assets from an external repository to your local device.

Subsequent Offline Use: Once these model assets are successfully saved to your device's local storage, all AI inference operates 100% offline without requiring further internet connectivity or transmitting data back to the external source.

3. Data We Collect
We do not collect, harvest, or request any personal data.

No Account Required: You do not need to create an account, log in, or provide personal details (such as your name, phone number, or email address) to use the full features of the app.

No Telemetry or Tracking: We do not track user behavior, feature usage analytics, or keystroke data.

4. Advertising Policy
Varna Text Processor is currently 100% ad-free. The application does not integrate any third-party advertising SDKs, tracking pixels, or cross-app ad identifiers.

5. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be made available by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this policy inside the app or on our store listing page.

